2000                 / subr -- called by DYPAL to search mnemonic tables
2001                 / tables are of two formats: (1) each entry is 4 wds -- a mask, a neg match,
2002                 / and a 2 wd text msg; (2) each entry is 4 wds -- a neg match, and a 3 wd text
2003                 / msg.  Each table is terminated with a single zero wd.  Format (1) requires a
2004                 / NOP at location SYINS, while format (2) requires a JMP SYJ1.  For each entry
2005                 / in a format (1) table, the word in DPVAL is anded with the mask and compared
2006                 / with the match; if the result is equal, the 2 wd text msg is printed.  For
2007                 / each entry in a format (2) table, the word in DPVAL is compared with the
2008                 / match; if the result is equal, the 3 wd text msg is printed.
2009   013123  7412  SYSCH,  XX
2010   013124  1723          TAD I   SYSCH           / get NOP or JMP SYJ1 instruction
2011   013125  2323          ISZ     SYSCH
2012   013126  3336          DCA     SYINS
2013   013127  1723          TAD I   SYSCH           / get table address
2014   013130  2323          ISZ     SYSCH
2015   013131  3123  SYLP,   DCA     SYTMP
